PXA Sans SC Regular (SIL Open Font License 1.1)

Based on the previously bundled Noto Sans SC system subset, preserving all
of its mapped characters and outlines. Additional Chinese mainland glyphs
come from Noto Sans CJK SC Regular, Version 2.004, face 2 of the upstream
NotoSansCJK-Regular.ttc collection.

Noto Sans CJK SC copyright: 2014-2021 Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/).
Noto is a trademark of Google Inc.

The derivative's internal family name is PXA Sans SC. It retains the legacy
filename noto_sans_cjk_common.ttf for existing firmware and simulator paths.
The accompanying OFL.txt is the font license. This file must accompany the
font when distributing it, along with OFL.txt.

Build tool: tools/fonts/build_common_font.py
Coverage: previous system subset + Big5 level-one Chinese characters + all
non-whitespace characters of the unmodified Gutenberg/GITenberg Xi You Ji
acceptance corpus. This is not a complete Unicode font. Unknown characters
have a visible .notdef outline instead of disappearing.

